WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.040
The project was so corrupt that Congress actually asked me to testify before them on the tremendous

00:00:07.040 --> 00:00:11.840
waste of money, because it turned out that they had no idea what it was, but they knew

00:00:11.840 --> 00:00:18.320
it was anywhere between $2 and $4 billion, as opposed to $500 million with a guarantee.

